## Item 4. Soccer empirical table — per-cell n and fallback level (the 15'/30' collapse, and the fix)
  fit rows 46075  min cell 30  cells by level: {"0":61,"1":35,"2":9,"3":0,"4":0}
    WHY the 15'/30' cells collapsed: ONLY the extreme diff cells are thin. At 15' the
    exact (15,'+3') cell has n=10 and at 30' the (30,'-3') cell has n=23, both below
    minCell, so they fell back to a neighbour/minute estimate. The OLD neighbour pool
    reached the whole difference axis, so it returned a nonsense value (trailing by 3 at
    15' scored a HIGHER home rate than trailing by 1), and the isotonic step then merged
    that value with the direct diff 1/2 cells — flattening "up 1/2/3" onto one number.
    THE FIX: (a) the neighbour pool is now LOCAL (|k-d| <= 1); (b) the monotone fit runs
    on the DIRECT cells (levels 0-1) only and the fallback cells are EXTENDED on the
    curve's local slope, so distinct goal differences keep distinct values.
    Per-cell audit of the flagged cells (n = raw cell counts; level = fallback used):
      minute diff | n(cell) n(min,diff) n(min) usedN level dir | pooled P(H/D/A)          | table P(H/D/A)
         15    1 |    1378       1391   9215   1378     0  D  | 0.6814/0.1872/0.1313     | 0.6814/0.1872/0.1313
              → exact (minute,diff,red) cell has n=1378 >= minCell
         15    2 |     106        106   9215    106     0  D  | 0.8585/0.0849/0.0566     | 0.8585/0.0849/0.0566
              → exact (minute,diff,red) cell has n=106 >= minCell
         15    3 |      10         10   9215     63     2  F  | 0.8492/0.0873/0.0635     | 0.9989/0.0010/0.0001
              → exact cell n=10 and (minute,diff) n=10 both < minCell=30; local neighbour pool over goal difference used
         15    0 |    6556       6614   9215   6556     0  D  | 0.4280/0.2865/0.2855     | 0.4280/0.2865/0.2855
              → exact (minute,diff,red) cell has n=6556 >= minCell
         30   -1 |    1470       1494   9215   1470     0  D  | 0.1864/0.2347/0.5789     | 0.1864/0.2347/0.5789
              → exact (minute,diff,red) cell has n=1470 >= minCell
